%% Lecturer Creates and Publishes an Exam
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Lecturer
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as Express API
    participant Auth as Auth and Role Middleware
    participant Controller as Exam Controller
    participant Service as Exam Service
    participant QuestionService as Question Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Lecturer->>UI: Complete create-exam form
    UI->>API: POST /api/exams + JWT
    API->>Auth: Verify JWT
    Auth->>Auth: Check LECTURER or ADMIN role
    Auth-->>API: Authorized request

    API->>Controller: createExam(request)
    Controller->>Controller: Validate exam data
    Controller->>Service: createExam(payload, userId)
    Service->>DB: INSERT exam
    DB-->>Service: Created exam record
    Service-->>Controller: Exam object
    Controller-->>UI: 201 Created + exam JSON
    UI-->>Lecturer: Display created exam

    loop Add each question
        Lecturer->>UI: Enter question and options
        UI->>API: POST /api/exams/:examId/questions
        API->>Auth: Verify role and exam ownership
        Auth-->>API: Authorized request
        API->>QuestionService: createQuestion(payload)
        QuestionService->>DB: BEGIN transaction
        QuestionService->>DB: INSERT question
        QuestionService->>DB: INSERT question options
        QuestionService->>DB: COMMIT transaction
        DB-->>QuestionService: Saved question
        QuestionService-->>UI: Question JSON
    end

    Lecturer->>UI: Select Publish Exam
    UI->>API: PATCH /api/exams/:id/publish
    API->>Auth: Verify role and ownership
    API->>Service: publishExam(examId)
    Service->>DB: UPDATE status to PUBLISHED
    DB-->>Service: Published exam
    Service-->>UI: Success response
    UI-->>Lecturer: Display published status
